  "description": "MacSync is a macOS-targeted infostealer first observed in\nNovember 2025 as a rebrand of the earlier Mac.c family. Its\nAppleScript payload writes an `Information.txt` file into the\nvictim staging directory combining a malware self-identification\nbanner, captured account credentials, and the verbatim output of\n`system_profiler`.",
  "aliases": [
    "Mac.c",
    "MacSync Stealer"
  ],
